{"author":"RebarBotNava","author_email":"joeoakhart+bot@navapbc.com","author_id":"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d","author_sig":"{\"payload\": \"\", \"payloadType\": \"application/vnd.rebar.authorship.v1+json\", \"signatures\": [{\"keyid\": \"594c-9dcf-5ad6-4e6d\", \"sig\": \"\"}]}","data":{"alias":"eaved-relaxatory-nandine","creation_channel":"cli","description":"## Context\nTwo clean `make test` runs while implementing story 4e3e-d36f-53b9-4c1e each completed 8,906 tests successfully and failed only `tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py::test_success_telemetry_survives_an_empty_usage_dict`: `caplog.records` contained no `llm call [` INFO record. The node passes in isolation, its full module passes 12/12, and the immediately preceding module plus it pass 21/21. This demonstrates a broader full-suite order/global-logging-state leak unrelated to bridge-fsck.\n\n## Approach\n- Reproduce with a minimized ordered prefix of the full collection and identify the earlier test or fixture that mutates logger level, propagation, handlers, disable state, or capture integration without restoring it.\n- Fix the leaking test/fixture or make the telemetry contract robust at the correct boundary; do not weaken the assertion merely to hide global state.\n- Add a regression that fails when the contaminating test and telemetry test run in the proven order.\n\n## Acceptance Criteria\n- [ ] A minimized deterministic test order reproduces the missing INFO capture before the fix and passes after it.\n- [ ] The responsible logger/capture global state is restored between tests, with a regression proving isolation.\n- [ ] `tests/unit/test_agent_call_seam.py` passes alone, after the contaminating test, and in the complete non-integration suite.\n- [ ] `make lint`, `make typecheck`, and `make test` pass.\n\n## Evidence\nBoth full-suite failures and focused pass counts are recorded on discovered-from story 4e3e-d36f-53b9-4c1e.","id":"d32b-3db5-9fd1-41e5","parent_id":"","priority":2,"tags":["test-isolation","logging"],"ticket_type":"bug","title":"Fix full-suite logging-state leak in agent-call telemetry test"},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"CREATE","timestamp":1785712248950248001,"uuid":"d4b767a9-e8fb-4d42-b9ee-ca58e42a2b83"}